=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf292a63b8ee063ba8a53ad3d72ec901, https://si.imgix.net/5a92a224/uploads/origins/e32d9baf-70d3-4470-a7c6-012fe8ebfac2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ee32384904a8d40fb12a3df23169c2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a92a224/uploads/origins/e32d9baf-70d3-4470-a7c6-012fe8ebfac2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1652db6ee652a1fe37cf0fb31985346f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "안녕하세요! 항상 귀여운 그림 잘 보고 있습니다!\n해당 X계정의 아이콘 용도의 그림을 부탁하고싶어요\n고양이와 오므라이스가 적절히 섞인 무언가가 보고싶습니다\n거절은 편하게 부탁드립니다! 감사합니다!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asoi002/works/896", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d73315a/uploads/origins/31434942-f7cb-4449-87df-13afc90e63d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bb146b31179ab04d5d60121a14caeec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5d73315a/uploads/origins/31434942-f7cb-4449-87df-13afc90e63d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bb146b31179ab04d5d60121a14caeec, https://si.imgix.net/5d73315a/uploads/origins/31434942-f7cb-4449-87df-13afc90e63d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9088f2b7ee6432de8ae1ad4cd5fab04e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5d73315a/uploads/origins/31434942-f7cb-4449-87df-13afc90e63d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4cadcb9b980b98b32b4a1be9a4fbd0e4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。いつもゆるくかわいいイラスト拝見しております。\n\n今回私のocを描いていただきたくリクエストさせていただきました。\n\nご縁がありましたら幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1zlRxbrvLMmJ4mwj7aqy7tCR5Jmkrel6d/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asoi002/works/895", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a7cee3a/uploads/origins/4c1de66e-1ff1-4741-9377-c1ddbf94a428?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfon